{title: Ye Tumhari Meri Baatein}
{artist: Rock On Shankar Mahadevan Farhan Akhtar}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Ye Tumhari Meri [Am]Baatein,        Hamesha [F]Yuhi Chal [C]ti Rahe
[C]Ye Humari Mula [Am]kaatein,        Hamesha [F]Yuhi Chal [C]ti Rahe
[G]Beetein [F]Yuhi Apne Saare, [C]Din Raat,        [G]Baaton [F]Se Nikalti Rahe, [C]Nayi Baat
[C]Phir Wahi Baatein [Am]Le Ke,        Geet [F]Koi Hum Li [C]khe
[C]Jo Dil [Am]Ko,        Ha Sab Ke [F]Dil Ko [C]Choole
[G]Baate [F]Suro Me Yuhi Pighal [C]ti Rahe,        [G]Baatein [F]Geetome Yuhi Dhal [C]ti Rahe
[C]Oo [Am]Oo [F]Oo [C],        Na Na [C]Na Na [Am]Na Na [F]Oo [C]
[G]Geeto Me [F]Huh Humko,        [C]Khushiyon Se [Am]Hum Sajaade
Jo Su [G]ne Kahe [F]Woh Humse, Gaa [C]na,        [C]Ye Tumhari Meri [Am]Baatein
Hamesha [F]Yuhi Chal [C]ti Rahe,        [C]Ye Humari Mula [Am]kaatein
